    65	## 跳到某個 tick：同一組陣型從頭快轉（確定性模擬，結果一定一樣），畫面與音效狀態清空重建。
    66	func _seek(target: int) -> void:
    67		_seek_begin(target)
    68		while not _seek_tick(1000000):
    69			pass
    70		_seek_finish()
    71	
    72	
    73	## 第七輪 M3：時間軸點下去不再卡畫面，分批算。headless 測試直接走 _seek。
    74	var _seek_stop := 0
    75	var _seek_ct := -1
    76	
    77	func _seek_async(target: int) -> void:
    78		if seek_target >= 0:
    79			return
    80		if DisplayServer.get_name() == "headless" or shot_dir != "":
    81			_seek(target)
    82			return
    83		seek_target = target
    84		_seek_begin(target)
    85	
    86	## 這一幀還在算就回傳 true（戰鬥畫面這一幀不動）。
    87	func _seek_pump() -> bool:
    88		if seek_target < 0:
    89			return false
    90		if _seek_tick(10):
    91			seek_target = -1
    92			_seek_finish()
    93		return true
    94	
    95	func _seek_begin(target: int) -> void:
    96		var armies2: Array = rv_last if play_kind == "review" and not rv_last.is_empty() else last_armies
    97		sim = Sim.new(armies2[0].copy(), armies2[1].copy(), battle_rules)
    98		call("_cmd_setup", sim, play_kind)
    99		ev_count = {}
   100		_seek_ct = -1
   101		battle_marks.clear()
   102		_seek_stop = maxi(0, target - ViewBuffer.DELAY)
   103		_seek_target_now = target
   104	
   105	var _seek_target_now := 0
   106	
   107	## 算到時間用完或到達目標；到達回傳 true。
   108	func _seek_tick(budget_ms: int) -> bool:
   109		var t0 := Time.get_ticks_msec()
   110		while sim.tick < _seek_stop and not sim.finished:
   111			if Time.get_ticks_msec() - t0 >= budget_ms:
   112				return false
   113			sim.step()
   114			for ev in sim.events:   # 快轉時也要累計戰報次數與時間軸標記（Codex S5 #4：共用同一個收集函式）
   115				if ev.has("src"):
   116					var s = sim.unit_by_id(ev["src"])
   117					var key := "%s%d" % [ev["kind"], s.team]
   118					ev_count[key] = int(ev_count.get(key, 0)) + 1
   119					if ev["kind"] == EV.BLAST and not ev.has("dmg"):
   120						ev_count["blast_fx%d" % s.team] = int(ev_count.get("blast_fx%d" % s.team, 0)) + 1
   121				_collect_mark(ev, sim, sim.tick)
   122			if _seek_ct < 0 and not sim.finished and clutch_cond(sim):
   123				_seek_ct = sim.tick
   124		return true
   125	
   126	func _seek_finish() -> void:
   127		var target := _seek_target_now
   128		var keep_ct := _seek_ct
   129		var had_clutch := keep_ct >= 0
   130		view = ViewBuffer.new(sim)
   131		prev_pos.clear()
   132		_gait_reset()
   133		for u in view.units:
   134			prev_pos[u.id] = Vector2(u.x, u.y)
   135		fx.clear()
   136		dying.clear()
   137		graves.clear()
   138		atk_hit.clear()
   139		atk_seq.clear()
   140		atk_t.clear()
   141		hurt_t.clear()
   142		hurt_dir.clear()
   143		brace_t.clear()
   144		accum = 0.0
   145		result_delay = 0.0
   146		clutch_t = 0.0
   147		slow_left = 0.0
   148		final_left = 0.0     # Codex v10-r1 #4：跳回前段不能留著慢動作，再播到末擊要再演
   149		final_used = false
   150		hitstop = 0.0
   151		# 演出狀態依目標時間重建（Codex S5 #5）：最後時刻是否已發生、是否已進狂熱、音樂
   152		slow_used = had_clutch
   153		clutch_tick = keep_ct if had_clutch else -1
   154		if had_clutch:
   155			battle_marks.append({"tick": keep_ct, "kind": "clutch", "team": -1})
   156		_pump_view()
   157		# 畫面推到剛好第 target tick（原本停在 target−DELAY）
   158		while view.tick < target and not view.finished:
   159			_sim_step(false)
   160		frenzy_seen = view.frenzy
   161		if sfx != null:
   162			sfx.play_music("music_frenzy" if view.frenzy else "music_battle")
